{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1790703420, "covers_from": "2026-09-29T17:37:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-09-29T17:38:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1790703480, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-09-29T17:37:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 6, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 43380, "sprite_key": "deer_suburb", "district": "wenshan", "topic": "觀光", "content": "台北市的觀光推廣要加強，貓空好無聊", "display_name": "文山代表 No.43,380", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-29T17:37:06+00:00", "duration_seconds": 12, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 50269, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "district": "wanhua", "topic": "交通", "content": "超商或是店家進貨時，大貨車都會為了卸貨違停，這部分該如何規範保護用路人的安全？", "display_name": "萬華代表 No.50,269", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-29T17:37:18+00:00", "duration_seconds": 11, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 37674, "sprite_key": "beaver_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "城市修繕", "content": "台北好多舊公寓 真的很醜 如果都更很難 但至少可以把一些公寓外面拉皮吧", "display_name": "大安代表 No.37,674", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-29T17:37:29+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 39580, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "環境", "content": "台北市政府最近一直砍樹，能否協助偵辦砍樹的原因並啟動調查相關人員疏失，才能幫忙因此失去家的小動物究責", "display_name": "信義代表 No.39,580", "mood": "angry", "is_replay": true}, {"starts_at": "2026-09-29T17:37:44+00:00", "duration_seconds": 16, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 21632, "sprite_key": "beaver_business", "district": "xinyi", "topic": "城市修繕", "content": "台北市老舊公寓不僅有礙市容，安全其實也很有隱憂。歷任市長雖然都想推動都更，但似乎成效不彰，到底有沒有", "display_name": "信義代表 Sean Wu", "mood": "caring", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 50269, "sprite_key": "squirrel_oldtown", "display_name": "萬華代表 No.50,269", "district": "wanhua", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 37674, "sprite_key": "beaver_culture", "display_name": "大安代表 No.37,674", "district": "daan", "is